## Type of Change

Select all that apply:

- [ ] `feat           ` — A new feature (adds functionality without breaking changes)
- [ ] `fix            ` — A bug fix (resolves an issue without breaking changes)
- [ ] `refactor       ` — Code change that neither adds a feature nor fixes a bug
- [ ] `perf           ` — A code change that improves performance
- [ ] `test           ` — Adding missing tests or correcting existing tests
- [ ] `docs           ` — Documentation-only changes
- [ ] `chore          ` — Maintenance, dependencies, CI/CD, or tooling updates
- [ ] `BREAKING CHANGE` — Any change that breaks backwards compatibility or existing APIs

